<title>USA: Coastal says Q3 joint ventures increased $15.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Coastal says Q3 joint ventures increased $15.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Corp said Friday that joint-venture profits helped ensure increased operating profit for the third quarter this year, and that exploration and production was the company's fastest-growing segment.</p>
<p>Coastal's share of joint-venture profits increased $15.8 million for the third quarter.  Without that growth,  overall operating profit was $147.9 million, down from $151.5 million in the year-earlier period.</p>
</text>
